{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D#m]This is the family [C#]history of Esau
[Bmaj7]He is Edom in the hill [C#]country of Seir
[D#m]Esau took his wives from [C#]the daughters of Canaan
[Bmaj7]Adah and Oholi[C#]bamah and Base[D#m]math came
Their possessions were [C#]too great to live together
[B]The land could not support [A#m]their livestock there
So E[D#m]sau moved away [F#]from his brother [C#]Jacob
And settled in the [D#m]land that bears his name
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F#]When Shaul died, Baal-Ha-nan [C#]son of Achbor succeeded him as king
