{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Before any [C#]king reigned over [D#m]the Israelites
There were kings [C#]who reigned in the land of [B]Edom [C#]
[D#m]Shaul from Rehoboth on [C#]the River suc[B]ceeded Samlah
