Hadar reigned in [C#]his place, his c[D#m]ity was [B]named Pai
Mehetabel [C#]was his wife, daughter [A#m]of Matred
[D#m]The line of Esau grew in the hill coun[F#]try of Seir
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
